    title: >-
      Tables of X-Ray Mass Attenuation Coefficients and Mass Energy-Absorption Coefficients from
      1 keV to 20 MeV for Elements Z = 1 to 92 and 48 Additional Substances of Dosimetric Interest
      (NISTIR 5632, NIST Standard Reference Database 126)
    authors:
